    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Creates an obligation to support Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander arts practice.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The First Nations Board has a number of functions, including to support and invest in a diverse range of Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander arts practice.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "There is an obligation to support Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander arts practice.";
