    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "supports";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Justifies the need for the First Nations Board to support Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander arts practice.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The First Nations Board has a number of functions, including to support and invest in a diverse range of Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander arts practice.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "Supporting Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander arts practice is necessary for the effective functioning of the First Nations Board.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::argumentation";
